      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Balaamu aho wadeeba hape gīkī ū SEEBA atogilwe kūbafuuha a Baisilaeli, akoya ū kūtūmamīla ī nzīla ja būchūūja gīt'ūmo wītīlaga ī ng'hangala ī jingī; ī likanza lyenīlo ūloja ū būshū wakwe ū kwitogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Balaamu aho wabūūcha a miso gakwe ūbabona a Baisilae būlī bene balī ū mu ng'hambī jabo, ū Moyo o ng'wa Mulungu ūng'wikīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandya kūhanga alīhaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būpelanu o ng'wa Balaaki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū būpelanu o ng'wa Balaaki būpembeka kīngī nasho ū kūlī Balaamu. Witūla ng'hūbi; ūng'wīla, “Ū nene naakwitanile kwiza kūzuma banishi bane, alīyo ī ng'hangala ī jose īji būdatū wajo wabafuuha dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īngaga nīyo a henaha lūūlū ūje kū ng'wako ūko! Ū nene naalī nahayile gīkī nakūkwinha mheela nhaale, alīyo īhaha ū SEEBA wakūlecha ī mheela yenīyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Balaamu ūnshokeja ū Balaaki alīhaya, “Abo ūkabatūma kwiza kūnitana, natabawīlile gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ū Balaaki nūūlū akaninha ī numba yakwe y'ikūlū yokalile pa hela na zahabu, natīīko kwīta mhayo gose gose ūyo gūlī hanze ya shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, nūūlū gūkabiza gwawiza nūūlū gwabūbi; shitaniigelile kūgelela kūhaya dūhū īyo SEEBA alīyīhaya?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ī haha naja kaya ū nene, gwike degelekaga lūūlū nakūhūgūle, wīmane īyo bakwīta a banhū benaba ū kū banhū bako, ū kū shikū ja kū būjiiwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balaamu na ja kanè",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Balaamu ūfunya ū būhangi wakwe ūbū:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balaamu kūmalīīja būhangi wakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Balaamu ūgalūka, ūlolela kū sī ya Baamaleki, ūfunya būhangi akūhayaga gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
